  "description": "The garden's agent panels: one agent's (or a gardener loop's runs') real LiteLLM bill over time, context size, turns and tokens. Embedded panel by panel on the agent face and the Gardener panel in /garden; panel ids are fixed by the garden's embed registry. Set `agent` to a name, or names joined by |.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "All gardenio boards",
