  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this board",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**One agent, or a gardener loop's runs: what they cost, how full their context is, how many turns they took.** This board feeds the agent face and the Gardener panel inside `/garden` (one solo panel per card, plan gd-gh5J0vVbJP step 4.2). The panel ids are fixed and pinned by the garden's embed registry, so **do not renumber or delete a panel**: add new ones with new ids.\n\n- **`agent`** is a text box holding an agent name, or several joined by `|` (the garden sends a gardener's runs that way). Every selector matches it anchored, so `.*` is every agent.\n- **Cost** reads the per-agent spend-logs gauge `gardenio_agent_spend_logs_usd` (the real LiteLLM bill, the `/costs` \"Per-agent cost over time\" query scoped to `$agent`). It only holds agents born in the sweep's ~48 h lookback and is never `increase()`d (it is Reset+Set each sweep).\n- **Context, turns and tokens** read the session series `gb` pushes while a session runs (`gardenio_session_context_tokens`, `gardenio_session_turns_total`, `gardenio_session_tokens_total`, label `agent_name`). Turns and context are per session: a restarted agent starts a new line.\n\nRetention is 30 days. USD figures are operator-only."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spend so far",
      "description": "The selected agents' real LiteLLM bill now, summed over models, from the per-agent spend-logs gauge (an instant read of the sweep's ~48 h lookback; the time picker does not move it). Amber at $10, red at $25 for one agent.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "victoriametrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "noValue": "not in the sweep lookback",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#e0b400",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "#d64545",
                "value": 25
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum(max by (agent, project, role, model, account) (gardenio_agent_spend_logs_usd{account!~\"(?i:e2e-.*|probe-acct-.*)\", agent=~\"$agent\"}))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
